name: Readable frozen settings, exact JSON and independent reading positions
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign owned-settings-reader
require-live-snap: 25 owned-settings-reader | unapproved-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-form
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | source-overview
keys: Tab Tab z
require-live-snap: 10 PREPARED SETTINGS | settings-120x36
expect: current tool descriptors
expect: SCAN SETTINGS
expect: Tab JSON
ask: Do the frozen values and current descriptor help read as settings, with exact field names and a visibly separate JSON view, without implying approval or execution?
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-0
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-8
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-9
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-10
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-11
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-12
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-13
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-14
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-15
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-16
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-17
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-18
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-19
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-20
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-21
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-22
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-23
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-24
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-40x12-25
keys: PPage
live-snap: settings-before-json-40x12
keys: Tab Home
require-live-snap: 10 EXACT PREPARED OPTIONS | raw-page-40x12-0
expect: Tab Overview
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: raw-page-40x12-7
keys: BTab
live-snap: settings-retained-position-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: settings-end-40x12
expect-not: kz> End
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART paged
ask: Can every recorded setting and every exact JSON field be read at 40x12, with independent scroll positions and visible back controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 10 PREPARED SETTINGS | settings-returned-wide
keys: z
require-live-snap: 10 PLAN A STUDY | returned-settings-form
expect: PREPARED SETTINGS
keys: Tab z Home
require-live-snap: 10 EXACT PREPARED OPTIONS | raw-120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read-only
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-ready
submit: campaign owned-settings-reader
require-live-snap: 25 owned-settings-reader | no-color-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | no-color-form
keys: Down Down Down Tab Tab z
require-live-snap: 10 PREPARED SETTINGS | no-color-settings
expect: current tool descriptors
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 10 EXACT PREPARED OPTIONS | no-color-json
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does restart keep the same unapproved plan, values and readable settings in no-color mode without new jobs, approvals, scanner or provider work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
